; BUG-004 support: a CBORK library whose private root name `all`
; collides with another independent library's private root `all`.
; The consumer imports both libraries (no `from` clause, no alias)
; but does not directly select or reference either library's
; private `all` root.  Before the fix, the two independent
; libraries' private roots merged into one consumer namespace and
; produced a false E013 plain-vs-generic collision on `all`.

;@ CBORK: Library
;@ CBORK: Export
foo = all

all = uint